	"FriendlyName": "MotionForge Live Link",
	"Description": "Receives motion generated by MotionForge in Blender and publishes it as a Live Link subject, so a character can be driven from a text prompt while the motion is still being made. Pairs with the SMPL plugin, which computes pose correctives from whatever pose arrives.",
